DEFECT c7-III-02LM-smooth-types D27 maps:src:D.2.45 The full actual formula is P=-K/2 mod b, lambda=-K mod b, mu=0 with the eleven corrected K values in D45.18. Eight P/model assignments change: OS45/II(1,8) zero2 O/F gives P4 and Z8,1; OS55/II(5,4) zero3 O/F gives P0 and Z4,0; OS55/default(1,20) zeros2,4 and OS55/II(1,20) zero3 O/F give P4 and Z4,0#Z5,1. Other three assignments remain. The preserved orders of P are respectively2 versus0,0 versus2,5 versus10; every group automorphism is multiplication by a unit with inverse unit and preserves these orders. All eleven patterns and all allowed finite parameters stand under retained maps:src:D.2.45, maps:eq:D45.3, tag028V.
DEFECT c7-III-02LM-critical-fan D25 maps:eq:D45.18 The historical cusp routine puts a unit fan in S with long basis LC^-1. The stipulated fan uses short SC and long L. The exact coordinate map is diag(C,C), inverse diag(C^-1,C^-1), with character exponent C^t and actual cone map C Sigma. The line map is the actual Gaussian plus reciprocal integral monomial from phi(Cj)=-psi(j)+L0j. Its positive critical sum has Omega=a-ab kappa-b+ab^2 kappa^2. All eleven corrected integers and full integral return preimages are supplied. This is a false intermediate geometric input; the symbolic Smith equations on the old supplied vectors do not identify the actual curves.
DEFECT c7-III-02LM-rational-character D25 maps:src:D.2.45 For the actual prescribed fan r_C=(b/2)(a kappa(b kappa-1)-1). At b20 the C4 pair is (0,0) except default zero3, where it is (2,0). A common Borel shift changes both characters together and cannot turn relative0 into relative2. The corrected whole-coefficient localization polynomial still vanishes, so full mu=0 is retained.
DEFECT c7-III-02LM-global-line-maps D22 maps:src:D.2.45 Supply the actual angular-disc inverse and omitted-II exterior Z² generator, zero swept values, literal C_b lift, period Gaussian and integral Cartier/monomial factors with reciprocal inverses and every unit. The common Borel shift and integrally lifted mixed term are then proved on the full exterior group in the next items.
DEFECT c7-III-02LM-coprime-inverses D22 maps:src:D.2.45 The full CW homotopy equivalence stands; supply its cellular inverse q with qi=id and iq homotopic to id relative wedge. The coefficient CRT inverse is5x4+16x5; bordism inverse is factor inclusions then that map. The model marking is Phi(e4)=5s,Phi(e5)=4s with inverse x->(x mod4,4x mod5). The constant-neck spin one-handle gives connected-sum addition. Both refined b20 types are retained.
